---

**Summary of Fix:**
- Added a `showItemTitle` prop to both `Cascader` and `CascaderMenuItem`.
- Default is `true` for backward compatibility.
- When `showItemTitle={false}` is set, the `title` attribute is not rendered on menu items, thus removing the tooltip.

**Usage Example:**
```jsx
<Cascader showItemTitle={false} ... />
```

This will remove the tooltip/title from all menu items as requested.
